    <string name="onb_1_title">What this app does</string>
    <string name="onb_2_title">Permissions you will be asked for</string>
    <string name="onb_2_body">Phone (place calls, see call state), Microphone (level checks only), Notifications and Bluetooth. Optionally the default phone app role, which is the only supported way to see detailed call states, switch audio route and end calls. Nothing is granted silently.</string>
    <string name="onb_3_title">Pair with your PC – no account needed</string>
    <string name="onb_3_body">There is no login and no cloud account. On the Windows PC open Devices › Pair, then enter the PC\'s IP, the pairing code and the certificate fingerprint here. Pairing is the sign-in; you can disconnect at any time.</string>

